    for x in v.iter() {
    {"code": "E0252", "severity": "error", "message": "`for` runs over a range of integers only", "file": "err/ranges.bmb", "line": 6, "col": 18, "end_line": 6, "end_col": 26, "fix": {"message": "iterate over the indices: `for i in 0..v.len()` and read `v[i]`"}}

Everything else the program prints must stay as it is.

